{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached or visible, take and move it, check properties, perform a specific task. Else, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation1    /> <Action ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation2    /> <Action ID = PutObjectDown    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
